01:14:48,485 --> 01:14:52,447
<i>So, Lone Starr,
Yogurt has taught you well.</i>

1246
01:14:53,573 --> 01:14:56,868
<i>If there's one thing
I despise,
it is a fair fight.</i>

1247
01:14:57,243 --> 01:14:59,412
<i>But if I must,
then I must.</i>

1248
01:14:59,579 --> 01:15:01,414
<i>May the best man win.</i>

1249
01:15:02,415 --> 01:15:03,917
<i>Put her there.</i>

1250
01:15:07,671 --> 01:15:11,800
<i>The ring! I can't believe
you fell for
the oldest trick in the book.</i>

1251
01:15:12,258 --> 01:15:16,429
<i>What a goof!
What's with you, man?
Come on.</i>

1252
01:15:16,805 --> 01:15:19,182
<i>You know what?
Here, let me give it
back to you.</i>

1253
01:15:19,265 --> 01:15:21,685
<i>Look at that!
You fell for that, too.</i>

1254
01:15:21,768 --> 01:15:23,728
<i>I can't believe it, man.</i>

1255
01:15:25,689 --> 01:15:30,402
<i>So, Lone Starr, now you see
that evil will always triumph</i>

1256
01:15:30,902 --> 01:15:32,904
<i>because good is dumb.</i>

1257
01:15:42,539 --> 01:15:44,708
<i>Very impressive,
Lone Starr.</i>

1258
01:15:45,166 --> 01:15:48,128
<i>Too bad this isn't
the</i> Wide World of Sports.

1259
01:15:49,003 --> 01:15:52,340
<i>YOGURT: Use the Schwartz,
Lone Starr.
Use the Schwartz.</i>

1260
01:15:52,424 --> 01:15:54,676
I can't.
I lost the ring.

1261
01:15:54,759 --> 01:15:57,595
<i>Forget the ring.
The ring is bupkis.</i>

1262
01:15:57,679 --> 01:16:00,014
<i>I found it
in a Cracker Jack box.</i>

1263
01:16:00,432 --> 01:16:04,227
<i>The Schwartz is in you,
Lone Starr. It's in you.</i>

1264
01:16:04,310 --> 01:16:06,438
All right. I'll try.

1265
01:16:06,813 --> 01:16:09,357
<i>Say goodbye to
your two best friends.</i>

1266
01:16:09,733 --> 01:16:12,652
<i>And I don't mean your pals
in the Winnebago.</i>

1267
01:16:18,074 --> 01:16:19,492
(SCREAMING)

1268
01:16:21,327 --> 01:16:24,164
<i>AUTOMATED VOICE:
Thank you for pressing
the self-destruct button.</i>

1269
01:16:24,247 --> 01:16:27,333
<i>This ship will self-destruct
in three minutes.</i>

1270
01:16:27,459 --> 01:16:29,002
(ALARM BLARING)

1271
01:16:32,005 --> 01:16:35,592
What's going on?
Where the hell
are we? Paris?

1272
01:16:35,675 --> 01:16:37,969
<i>Thank you for pressing
the self-destruct button.</i>

1273
01:16:38,052 --> 01:16:42,515
<i>This ship will self-destruct
in exactly two minutes
and 45 seconds.</i>

1274
01:16:42,599 --> 01:16:45,101
You've got to stop it.
Is there any way
to stop it?

1275
01:16:45,185 --> 01:16:47,270
I can't.
It's irreversible.

1276
01:16:47,353 --> 01:16:48,938
Like my raincoat.

1277
01:16:49,022 --> 01:16:52,066
<i>Attention, this is
Colonel Sandurz
in forward command.</i>

1278
01:16:52,150 --> 01:16:53,610
<i>Abandon ship!</i>

1279
01:16:53,735 --> 01:16:56,321
<i>All personnel proceed
to escape pods.</i>

1280
01:16:56,404 --> 01:16:59,282
<i>Close down the circus.
Evacuate the zoo.</i>

1281
01:16:59,365 --> 01:17:03,203
<i>The self-destruct mechanism
has been activated.
Abandon ship.</i>

1282
01:17:04,037 --> 01:17:07,624
Sandurz, you gotta help me.
I don't know what to do.

1283
01:17:07,707 --> 01:17:10,418
I can't make decisions.
I'm a president!

1284
01:17:10,627 --> 01:17:12,587
<i>AUTOMATED VOICE: This is
your two-minute warning.</i>

1285
01:17:12,670 --> 01:17:15,673
<i>This ship will self-destruct
in exactly two minutes.</i>

1286
01:17:15,757 --> 01:17:18,843
<i>SANDURZ ON PA:
Launch all escape pods
as soon as they are filled.</i>

1287
01:17:19,177 --> 01:17:20,887
What's happening?
Where is he?

1288
01:17:21,221 --> 01:17:23,097
<i>CHORUS: (SINGING)
Spaceballs</i>

1289
01:17:23,598 --> 01:17:25,016
<i>Watch out!</i>

1290
01:17:27,852 --> 01:17:29,521
Where is he?
LONE STARR: Here.

1291
01:17:29,604 --> 01:17:31,898
We've got a minute and 40
before the end of the world.
Hang on.

1292
01:17:32,398 --> 01:17:34,275
<i>Spaceballs</i>

1293
01:17:36,736 --> 01:17:38,029
Full throttle.
Full throttle.

1294
01:17:38,112 --> 01:17:39,781
Go to hyper-jets!
Going to hyper-jets.

1295
01:17:41,616 --> 01:17:45,745
<i>MAN: (SINGING)
If you're livin' in a bubble
and you haven't got a care</i>

1296
01:17:45,829 --> 01:17:47,872
Get out of there.
Where do you think
you're going?

1297
01:17:47,956 --> 01:17:49,123
Pizza to go!

1298
01:17:49,249 --> 01:17:51,000
<i>Well, you're gonna
be in trouble</i>

1299
01:17:51,084 --> 01:17:53,002
<i>'Cause we're gonna
steal your air</i>

1300
01:17:56,464 --> 01:17:58,424
<i>'Cause what you got
is what we need</i>

1301
01:17:58,508 --> 01:18:00,510
<i>And all we do
is dirty deeds</i>

1302
01:18:00,593 --> 01:18:02,887
<i>We're the Spaceballs</i>

1303
01:18:03,096 --> 01:18:04,055
<i>Watch out!</i>

1304
01:18:04,138 --> 01:18:06,975
<i>'Cause we're
the Spaceballs</i>

1305
01:18:07,058 --> 01:18:08,434
(GROWLING)

1306
01:18:11,229 --> 01:18:13,439
That's my escape pod.
Who are you?

1307
01:18:13,523 --> 01:18:16,943
I'm the bearded lady.
What are you,
one of the freaks?

1308
01:18:17,443 --> 01:18:18,778
(LAUGHING)

1309
01:18:19,279 --> 01:18:22,532
Come back!
That's my pod! No!

1310
01:18:26,035 --> 01:18:28,788
Come back, you fat,
bearded bitch!

1311
01:18:29,956 --> 01:18:34,085
One pod left.
And three of us.
And I'm the president.

1312
01:18:34,335 --> 01:18:36,671
Well, boys,
it's a very lovely ship.

1313
01:18:36,754 --> 01:18:38,756
I think you should
go down with it.

1314
01:18:39,132 --> 01:18:40,425
Goodbye!

1315
01:18:43,887 --> 01:18:46,180
What the hell's
the matter
with this seat belt?

1316
01:18:46,264 --> 01:18:47,599
(SCREAMING)

1317
01:18:47,682 --> 01:18:48,975
(GROWLS)

1318
01:18:50,143 --> 01:18:51,519
(LAUGHING)

1319
01:18:53,771 --> 01:18:55,231
<i>Spaceballs</i>

1320
01:18:55,315 --> 01:18:58,276
<i>AUTOMATED VOICE:
This ship will self-destruct
in 20 seconds.</i>

1321
01:18:58,359 --> 01:19:01,279
<i>This is your last chance
to push
the cancellation button.</i>

1322
01:19:01,362 --> 01:19:03,823
Cancellation button?
Hurry!

1323
01:19:05,325 --> 01:19:07,577
<i>CHORUS: (SINGING)
Spaceballs</i>

1324
01:19:07,660 --> 01:19:09,245
(ALL EXCLAIMING)

1325
01:19:11,372 --> 01:19:12,874
Where is it?

1326
01:19:12,957 --> 01:19:14,250
It's gotta be here.

1327
01:19:14,334 --> 01:19:15,293
SKROOB:
Out of order?

1328
01:19:15,376 --> 01:19:17,795
Fuck!
Even in the future
nothing works.

1329
01:19:17,879 --> 01:19:21,174
<i>AUTOMATED VOICE:
This ship will self-destruct
in exactly 10 seconds.</i>

1330
01:19:21,257 --> 01:19:22,425
(ALL SHUDDERING)

1331
01:19:22,508 --> 01:19:23,927
<i>Counting down.</i>

1332
01:19:24,010 --> 01:19:25,678
<i>Ten. Nine.</i>

1333
01:19:26,304 --> 01:19:27,263
<i>Eight.</i>

1334
01:19:27,347 --> 01:19:28,348
<i>Six.</i>

1335
01:19:28,431 --> 01:19:30,433
Six? What happened
to seven?

1336
01:19:30,516 --> 01:19:32,018
<i>Just kidding.</i>

1337
01:19:32,518 --> 01:19:33,561
There's
the other end.
Faster!

1338
01:19:33,645 --> 01:19:34,646
<i>Seven.</i>

1339
01:19:34,729 --> 01:19:37,732
<i>Six. Five. Four.</i>

1340
01:19:37,815 --> 01:19:40,610
<i>Three. Two. One.</i>

1341
01:19:41,194 --> 01:19:42,737
<i>Have a nice day.</i>

1342
01:19:42,820 --> 01:19:44,364
ALL: Thank you.

1343
01:19:54,874 --> 01:19:56,209
VESPA: We did it!

1344
01:19:56,292 --> 01:19:57,794
(ALL CHEERING)

1345
01:19:59,212 --> 01:20:00,505
(HOWLING)

1346
01:20:03,383 --> 01:20:04,968
We all did it.

1347
01:20:07,220 --> 01:20:09,055
(SPACEBALLS SCREAMING)

1348
01:20:24,070 --> 01:20:28,491
<i>So, I guess you might
call that a case
of man bites droid?</i>

1349
01:20:31,452 --> 01:20:34,122
<i>On a sadder note,
Pizza the Hutt,</i>

1350
01:20:34,205 --> 01:20:38,793
<i>famed half man, half pizza,
was found dead earlier today</i>

1351
01:20:38,876 --> 01:20:41,671
<i>in the back seat
of his stretched limo.</i>

1352
01:20:41,754 --> 01:20:43,798
<i>Evidently,
the notorious gangster</i>

1353
01:20:43,881 --> 01:20:47,760
<i>became locked in his car
and ate himself to death.</i>

1354
01:20:48,469 --> 01:20:52,682
<i>Coming up, Pongo's review
of</i> Rocky 5,000.

1355
01:20:53,975 --> 01:20:54,976
<i>Pongo.</i>

1356
01:20:55,059 --> 01:20:56,185
<i>PONGO: Whoever said
when you've seen...</i>

1357
01:20:56,269 --> 01:20:58,771
Did you hear that?
Pizza kicked the bucket.

1358
01:20:58,855 --> 01:21:03,109
Now we don't have to
pay him the million.
We can keep it for ourselves.

1359
01:21:03,276 --> 01:21:04,527
(SIGHING)

1360
01:21:22,628 --> 01:21:23,838
Daddy!

1361
01:21:24,589 --> 01:21:27,884
Vespa, my darling.
I thought I'd never
see you again.

1362
01:21:27,967 --> 01:21:32,513
My sweet little daughter.
I'm so happy that
you're home and safe.

1363
01:21:32,764 --> 01:21:36,642
And, little Vespa,
here's someone else
who's happy to see you.

1364
01:21:39,729 --> 01:21:42,774
Hello.
Where have you been?

1365
01:21:48,863 --> 01:21:50,865
(MUSIC PLAYING ON RADIO)

1366
01:21:58,623 --> 01:21:59,999
Thanks, hon.

1367
01:22:05,338 --> 01:22:07,173
(ROCK MUSIC PLAYING)

1368
01:22:12,637 --> 01:22:15,807
Hiya, big stuff.
Hi, dream.

1369
01:22:16,182 --> 01:22:17,266
What will you have?

1370
01:22:17,350 --> 01:22:20,103
We just got a couple minutes
while we're gassing up.
What's ready?

1371
01:22:20,186 --> 01:22:22,563
I can give you
the space soup,
or the space special.

1372
01:22:22,647 --> 01:22:24,482
LONE STARR:
I'll have the soup.

1373
01:22:24,565 --> 01:22:25,733
Okay.

1374
01:22:25,817 --> 01:22:28,528
I'll have the cleavage.
Special.

1375
01:22:29,612 --> 01:22:32,615
Okay, one special
and one soup.

1376
01:22:35,993 --> 01:22:36,953
Ready to order?

1377
01:22:37,036 --> 01:22:38,079
Hi, yes.

1378
01:22:38,162 --> 01:22:39,497
We'll both have
the lunafish.

1379
01:22:39,580 --> 01:22:40,581
Anything to drink?

1380
01:22:40,665 --> 01:22:43,584
Hey, watch where
you're sticking
that thing.

1381
01:22:43,668 --> 01:22:44,669
(EXCLAIMS)

1382
01:22:44,752 --> 01:22:46,629
Look, it's got
a mind of its own,
sweetheart.

1383
01:22:46,712 --> 01:22:48,714
I can't do
a thing with it.

1384
01:22:49,048 --> 01:22:50,341
(HOWLING)

1385
01:22:54,971 --> 01:22:58,391
So, we were lost.
None of us knew
where we were.

1386
01:22:58,474 --> 01:23:02,520
And then Harry
began feeling around
on all the trees.

1387
01:23:02,603 --> 01:23:06,357
Then he said,
"I got it.
We on Pluto."

1388
01:23:06,816 --> 01:23:08,901
And we say,
"Harry, how can
you tell?"

1389
01:23:08,985 --> 01:23:11,612
He said,
"From the bark,
you dummies."

1390
01:23:16,409 --> 01:23:17,618
(GROANING)

1391
01:23:17,702 --> 01:23:18,703
Is he all right?

1392
01:23:18,786 --> 01:23:21,122
MAN 1: Yeah,
the guy digs me.

1393
01:23:21,205 --> 01:23:22,748
Hey, what's wrong
with this guy?

1394
01:23:22,832 --> 01:23:24,292
I don't know.

1395
01:23:24,417 --> 01:23:25,918
(JOHN GROANING)

1396
01:23:27,044 --> 01:23:28,504
Bring him
some water!

1397
01:23:28,588 --> 01:23:32,049
Water, my ass!
Bring this guy
some Pepto-Bismol!

1398
01:23:32,925 --> 01:23:36,012
Waitress!
What did he order?

1399
01:23:36,095 --> 01:23:37,805
He had the special.

1400
01:23:37,889 --> 01:23:40,641
That's what I ordered.
Change my order
to the soup.

1401
01:23:40,725 --> 01:23:41,809
Good move.

1402
01:23:41,934 --> 01:23:43,269
(GROANING)

1403
01:23:46,814 --> 01:23:48,149
(SNARLING)

1404
01:23:50,610 --> 01:23:53,738
Oh, no. Not again!

1405
01:23:55,823 --> 01:23:57,200
(EXCLAIMING)

1406
01:23:57,283 --> 01:23:58,618
(GROWLING)

1407
01:24:05,917 --> 01:24:08,252
(SINGING)
<i>Hello, my baby
Hello, my honey</i>

1408
01:24:08,336 --> 01:24:10,630
<i>Hello, my ragtime gal</i>

1409
01:24:10,713 --> 01:24:15,301
<i>Send me a kiss by wire
Baby, my heart's on fire</i>

1410
01:24:15,384 --> 01:24:17,762
<i>If you refuse me,
Honey, you'll lose me</i>

1411
01:24:17,845 --> 01:24:19,138
<i>Then you'll be
left alone</i>

1412
01:24:19,222 --> 01:24:24,185
<i>Oh, baby,
telephone and tell me
I'm your own</i>

1413
01:24:26,979 --> 01:24:28,481
BOTH: Check, please.

1414
01:24:39,158 --> 01:24:41,577
Five minutes
to magic time.

1415
01:24:41,661 --> 01:24:45,039
Are you all right,
my dear? You look
a little flighty.

1416
01:24:45,122 --> 01:24:48,542
Don't worry about me, Father.
I'm completely over him.

1417
01:24:48,668 --> 01:24:49,710
(SCOFFS)

1418
01:24:49,794 --> 01:24:51,587
Didn't even stay
for the wedding.

1419
01:24:51,671 --> 01:24:54,590
Just grabbed
his million space bucks
and ran.

1420
01:24:54,674 --> 01:24:56,759
He didn't
take the million.

1421
01:24:56,842 --> 01:24:58,094
He didn't?

1422
01:24:58,177 --> 01:25:03,057
No. He just took
248 space bucks for lunch,
gas and tolls.

1423
01:25:13,442 --> 01:25:15,778
I still can't believe
you turned down the money.

1424
01:25:15,861 --> 01:25:19,282
At least we could have
stayed for the wedding feast.
I'm starving.

1425
01:25:19,365 --> 01:25:21,575
Have you got
anything to eat?

1426
01:25:22,535 --> 01:25:25,746
Wait a minute.
Yogurt gave me
that fortune cookie.

1427
01:25:26,122 --> 01:25:27,373
Here, chow down.

1428
01:25:27,456 --> 01:25:29,292
Wow, thanks.
I'll split it
with you.

1429
01:25:29,375 --> 01:25:30,710
No.
Okay.

1430
01:25:35,089 --> 01:25:36,173
BOTH: Yogurt!

1431
01:25:36,257 --> 01:25:37,591
<i>Hello, boys.</i>

1432
01:25:37,842 --> 01:25:41,304
<i>Well, you opened
your fortune cookie,
so here's your fortune.</i>

1433
01:25:41,387 --> 01:25:45,308
<i>Lone Starr, you know
that medallion that
you wear around your neck</i>

1434
01:25:45,391 --> 01:25:47,476
<i>but you don't know
what it means?</i>

1435
01:25:47,560 --> 01:25:50,896
<i>Here's what it means.
It's a royal
birth certificate.</i>

1436
01:25:50,980 --> 01:25:55,443
<i>Yes! Your father was a king.
Your mother was a queen.</i>

1437
01:25:55,526 --> 01:25:59,155
<i>Which makes you
a certified prince.</i>

1438
01:25:59,238 --> 01:26:01,824
Hey, I'm a prince!

1439
01:26:01,907 --> 01:26:04,118
I'm a prince.
Which means...

1440
01:26:04,201 --> 01:26:08,331
<i>Which means, if you hurry,
there could be
a princess in your future.</i>

1441
01:26:08,414 --> 01:26:11,334
<i>If you want to get back there
before she marries
Sleeping Beauty,</i>

1442
01:26:11,417 --> 01:26:14,670
<i>there's a special can of fuel
in your glove compartment.</i>

1443
01:26:14,754 --> 01:26:15,755
<i>Good luck, boys.</i>

1444
01:26:15,838 --> 01:26:16,881
Bye, Yogurt.

1445
01:26:16,964 --> 01:26:19,675
And, Yogurt, thanks.

1446
01:26:19,759 --> 01:26:21,177
<i>You're welcome.</i>

1447
01:26:21,260 --> 01:26:25,473
<i>And may the Schwartz
be with you!</i>

1448
01:26:25,556 --> 01:26:27,308
<i>(SCATTING GIBBERISH)</i>

1449
01:26:30,478 --> 01:26:32,313
Barf, open that
glove compartment.

1450
01:26:32,396 --> 01:26:34,440
You got it,
Your Highness.

1451
01:26:37,818 --> 01:26:40,529
Wow! Liquid Schwartz!

1452
01:26:40,613 --> 01:26:42,531
Quick, pour it
in the emergency tank.

1453
01:26:42,615 --> 01:26:43,824
Right.

1454
01:26:47,078 --> 01:26:48,537
Look at that.

1455
01:26:50,164 --> 01:26:51,248
Done!

1456
01:26:51,332 --> 01:26:54,293
Hang on, Barf,
we're gonna
make spacetracks.

1457
01:26:54,377 --> 01:26:56,045
(ENGINES REVVING)

1458
01:27:04,428 --> 01:27:06,806
(SPACEBALLS SCREAMING)

1459
01:27:33,624 --> 01:27:35,126
(GULLS CAWING)

1460
01:27:47,179 --> 01:27:50,641
Dear me, what are
those things
coming out of her nose?

1461
01:27:52,184 --> 01:27:53,936
Hey, watch my helmet.

1462
01:27:54,019 --> 01:27:55,354
(GRUNTING)

1463
01:27:57,356 --> 01:27:59,316
Spaceballs?

1464
01:27:59,567 --> 01:28:02,278
Oh, shit.
There goes the planet.

1465
01:28:05,531 --> 01:28:09,410
Dearly beloved,
we are gathered
here together

1466
01:28:10,911 --> 01:28:12,121
again.

1467
01:28:12,204 --> 01:28:14,123
Why didn't you tell me
he didn't take the money?

1468
01:28:14,206 --> 01:28:16,125
I didn't think
it was important.

1469
01:28:16,208 --> 01:28:17,835
May I continue,
please?

1470
01:28:17,918 --> 01:28:20,546
Besides, he asked me
not to tell you.

1471
01:28:21,213 --> 01:28:22,548
Thank you.

